          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki Bala'amu guri báy, «Qwaláng ay amór hatlá' amoodae i bahh aán ala a sleémeerowooká. Daqaní inooín ki lu'ús as aníng.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Bala'amu kuri huúw nee Balaki ay baraá qamaá Sofimu gawaá ságw tloomár Pisga. Gawaadae kiteeraá ilahhooa awa faanqw gina tleéhh, dír umuúqo kitaango awuú wák nee gwaanduwo gina haniís.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
